## Features

- SSE streaming responses with typewriter effect
- Multi-modal input (image upload, voice recording)
- MiniMax Token Plan API integration
- MCP tool system
- RAG knowledge base
- Multi-agent collaboration with A2A protocol
- HITL human-in-the-loop confirmation
- Intent detection and clarification
- Enterprise admin dashboard

## Architecture

```
backend/src/
├── application/     # Application orchestration
├── domain/          # Core business logic (model/rag/agent/search)
├── infra/           # Infrastructure (metrics/alert/config/queue)
├── common/          # Common utilities (errors/)
├── routes/          # API endpoints
└── services/        # Business logic layer

frontend/src/
├── app/             # Next.js App Router pages
├── components/      # React components
├── stores/          # Zustand state management
├── hooks/           # Custom React hooks
└── lib/             # Utilities
```

## Quick Start

### Backend

```bash
cd backend
npm install
npm start
# Runs on port 30000
```

### Frontend

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
# Runs on port 3001
```

## Technology Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|------------|
| Frontend | React 19, Next.js 16, Zustand 5 |
| Backend | Express, Node.js |
| AI Model | MiniMax M2.7 (Token Plan) |
| Database | Qdrant (vector), SQLite (metadata) |
| Infrastructure | Prometheus, Redis |

